{"seq":5,"slug":"social-psychology","title":"社会心理学","stage":"DONE","category":"psychology","chapterCount":5,"docCount":20,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/social-psychology","rating":{"composite":3.63,"verdict":"stable","groups":{"quality":4,"coverage":3.5,"positioning":4,"strategic":3},"weights":{"quality":0.3,"coverage":0.25,"positioning":0.2,"strategic":0.25},"profile":{"composite":3.31,"verdict":"neutral","uScore":2.5}},"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"社会心理学-简介\">社会心理学 简介</h1><p>社会心理学是研究个体在社会情境中如何思考、感受和行为的学科，它揭示了人类作为社会性动物的深层心理机制。本模块面向具有理性思维能力的技术从业者和终身学习者，帮助读者理解日常工作与生活中无处不在的社会心理现象，从归因偏差到从众行为，从群体决策到偏见消除，从人际吸引到网络社交。</p>\n<p>第1章<strong>社会认知</strong>探讨人们如何理解和解释社会世界。从归因理论揭示我们如何解释他人行为的原因，到图式与刻板印象如何塑造我们对世界的预期，再到态度的形成与改变机制，最后深入分析认知失调这一驱动人类行为改变的核心动力。这些知识帮助读者识别自身认知中的系统性偏差。</p>\n<p>第2章<strong>社会影响</strong>聚焦于他人如何改变我们的行为和信念。从阿希的从众实验到米尔格拉姆的服从研究，从说服的双过程模型到社会规范的隐形力量，本章揭示了社会影响力的运作机制。理解这些原理对于技术团队的协作沟通和产品设计中的用户引导都具有直接的实践价值。</p>\n<p>第3章<strong>群体动力学</strong>分析个体在群体中行为发生变化的规律。群体决策中的极化与群体思维、社会促进与社会懈怠的双面效应、领导力在群体中的作用机制，以及群际冲突的根源与化解策略，这些议题对于理解技术团队的协作效能和组织行为至关重要。</p>\n<p>第4章<strong>偏见与歧视</strong>深入剖析人类社会中最具破坏性的心理现象之一。从偏见的认知、情感和社会根源，到内隐偏见的无意识运作，再到经过实证验证的偏见减少策略，最后审视歧视对受害者造成的多层面心理影响。这些知识对于构建包容性的技术团队和产品设计具有重要启示。</p>\n<p>第5章<strong>人际关系</strong>研究人与人之间联结的心理学基础。从吸引力的多元理论到亲社会行为的动机分析，从攻击性行为的心理学解释到数字时代在线社交行为的独特模式，本章帮助读者理解人类社会联结的本质，并将这些洞察应用于团队建设和产品社交功能的设计中。</p>\n<p>推荐学习路径为：先从第1章社会认知入手建立理论基础，掌握人类如何感知和解释社会世界；再学习第2章理解社会影响的力量与机制；然后进入第3章探索群体层面的心理规律；接着通过第4章认识偏见这一社会心理学的核心议题；最后在第5章中将视野扩展到人际关系的全景。五章内容层层递进，从个体认知到社会互动再到群体现象，构成一幅完整的社会心理学知识图谱。</p>\n","chapters":[{"seq":1,"slug":"social-cognition","title":"社会认知","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/social-psychology/social-cognition","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"attribution-theory","title":"归因理论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/social-psychology/social-cognition/attribution-theory"},{"seq":2,"slug":"schemas-stereotypes","title":"图式与刻板印象","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/social-psychology/social-cognition/schemas-stereotypes"},{"seq":3,"slug":"attitude-formation","title":"态度的形成与改变","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/social-psychology/social-cognition/attitude-formation"},{"seq":4,"slug":"cognitive-dissonance","title":"认知失调","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/social-psychology/social-cognition/cognitive-dissonance"}]},{"seq":2,"slug":"social-influence","title":"社会影响","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/social-psychology/social-influence","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"conformity","title":"从众","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/social-psychology/social-influence/conformity"},{"seq":2,"slug":"obedience","title":"服从","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/social-psychology/social-influence/obedience"},{"seq":3,"slug":"persuasion","title":"说服","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/social-psychology/social-influence/persuasion"},{"seq":4,"slug":"social-norms","title":"社会规范","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/social-psychology/social-influence/social-norms"}]},{"seq":3,"slug":"group-dynamics","title":"群体动力学","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/social-psychology/group-dynamics","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"group-decision-making","title":"群体决策","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/social-psychology/group-dynamics/group-decision-making"},{"seq":2,"slug":"social-facilitation","title":"社会促进与社会懈怠","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/social-psychology/group-dynamics/social-facilitation"},{"seq":3,"slug":"leadership-group","title":"群体中的领导力","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/social-psychology/group-dynamics/leadership-group"},{"seq":4,"slug":"intergroup-conflict","title":"群际冲突","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/social-psychology/group-dynamics/intergroup-conflict"}]},{"seq":4,"slug":"prejudice-discrimination","title":"偏见与歧视","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/social-psychology/prejudice-discrimination","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"origins-of-prejudice","title":"偏见的起源","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/social-psychology/prejudice-discrimination/origins-of-prejudice"},{"seq":2,"slug":"implicit-bias","title":"内隐偏见","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/social-psychology/prejudice-discrimination/implicit-bias"},{"seq":3,"slug":"reducing-prejudice","title":"减少偏见的策略","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/social-psychology/prejudice-discrimination/reducing-prejudice"},{"seq":4,"slug":"discrimination-effects","title":"歧视的效应","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/social-psychology/prejudice-discrimination/discrimination-effects"}]},{"seq":5,"slug":"interpersonal-relationships","title":"人际关系","docCount":4,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/social-psychology/interpersonal-relationships","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"attraction-theories","title":"吸引力理论","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/social-psychology/interpersonal-relationships/attraction-theories"},{"seq":2,"slug":"prosocial-behavior","title":"亲社会行为","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/social-psychology/interpersonal-relationships/prosocial-behavior"},{"seq":3,"slug":"aggression","title":"攻击性行为","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/social-psychology/interpersonal-relationships/aggression"},{"seq":4,"slug":"online-social-behavior","title":"在线社交行为","url":"/l-doc-books/h/psychology/social-psychology/interpersonal-relationships/online-social-behavior"}]}]}